. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CKbLHeLwFCIQ7kNvwEaxzpC&_nc_oc=AdmItJtCwsZO287qtIHyz3T269Y1j6F6IwQtcg9PmRERhM1vkdBZnJOWIQTxbJlMl0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvV9XJg-jHoKxdaxuNEGeuVshnLghjjk9GbA2LVB4PoEw&oe=69A82D3E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zk6I5w3Z82cQ7kNvwEjJ2Vy&_nc_oc=AdnxbH1-uS0Xx6jpB7GgtER8ERk6GWpn5MuGHDt_ySiEIFZKoLfhoZM_X7oPW7gypMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuscLod0PGVSMR_NxlYdq9oVReSAAmcyUoxBYe_6QqOMQ&oe=69A80B9E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UAbasYQ7b5IQ7kNvwELDGsI&_nc_oc=AdlVDdrUPKoVlg71s9XyNj2lv8rOf4y5buDWzxg8JUirzCNWf0myE2cL-S3kb-TBUHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afv-KdD8vnDFKMyTWiInZA6GMCWYKBKfz6UnY2LWS5GdIA&oe=69A8395B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1